{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/34af41a42318bf17afec33d5238de594.avif?t=1768197201\" width=1024 height=216 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You ride the portal to another world,</strong><br><strong>gather materials, cook meals, and craft furniture</strong><br><strong>to gradually grow your tavern.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange lands, run your tavern, craft equipment, farm your own ingredients\u2014<br>it\u2019s a laid-back yet immersive simulation full of variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/bb38502ea377577d9fe4f57634f0ab8f.avif?t=1768197201\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My uncle vanished, leaving behind a tavern.</strong><br>Inside a closet, I found a portal.<br>And just like that, I became the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve never run a business before,<br>but with free resources from another world, I cook, craft, build\u2026<br>and somehow, the tavern runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers show up for the food,<br>some out of curiosity,<br>and occasionally, just to puke from drinking.<br>(\u203b Yes, you\u2019ll have to kick out the drunks. Realistic, right?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking, crafting, managing, cleaning\u2014<br>it\u2019s all on me.<br>Pride? Nah. Just busy all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait\u2026 wasn\u2019t I forgetting something?<br>Oh, right. My uncle.<br>We\u2019ll find him eventually.<br>But first, let\u2019s get this tavern out of the red.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/daeb1e745de210583c88258a2715ed8b.avif?t=1768197201\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Explore Unknown Worlds Beyond the Rift!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From tranquil forests and mysterious mushroom colonies, to even modern convenience stores you could never have imagined! Explore dozens of randomly generated worlds every time you pass through a portal, and collect special ingredients for your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-This Ain't No Simple Management: Defend Your Tavern!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serving food to guests and building your reputation is just the basics. Sometimes you'll have to crack the skulls of rowdy drunks, and other times you'll have to clean up vomit from the floor yourself. This is realistic tavern management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Create Fantastic Dishes with Otherworldly Ingredients!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new recipes by combining mysterious ingredients brought from the dimensional rifts. From ordinary stews to magical beverages, the dishes born from your hands will decide the fate of your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Don't Miss Out on Power or Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Powerful equipment makes exploring more dangerous dimensions possible. But getting stronger isn't everything. Create your own unique protagonist with hundreds of combinations of outfits, armor, and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/36c282a95a5be849e6b9a64583746052.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/36c282a95a5be849e6b9a64583746052.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/36c282a95a5be849e6b9a64583746052.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-A Living Town and its Neighbors</strong> Rift Tavern is not in an isolated place. Meet the merchants who greet you warmly as you approach their shops, the bustling festival held every weekend, and the neighbors with their own unique personalities who come and go in the town. Sometimes, a peddler selling rare goods might even visit without notice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902150?t=1768197201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902150?t=1768197201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/eb019fe16df93461b378c5dcda60c47edafa694a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768197201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/eb019fe16df93461b378c5dcda60c47edafa694a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768197201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/34af41a42318bf17afec33d5238de594.avif?t=1768197201\" width=1024 height=216 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You ride the portal to another world,</strong><br><strong>gather materials, cook meals, and craft furniture</strong><br><strong>to gradually grow your tavern.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange lands, run your tavern, craft equipment, farm your own ingredients\u2014<br>it\u2019s a laid-back yet immersive simulation full of variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/bb38502ea377577d9fe4f57634f0ab8f.avif?t=1768197201\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My uncle vanished, leaving behind a tavern.</strong><br>Inside a closet, I found a portal.<br>And just like that, I became the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve never run a business before,<br>but with free resources from another world, I cook, craft, build\u2026<br>and somehow, the tavern runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers show up for the food,<br>some out of curiosity,<br>and occasionally, just to puke from drinking.<br>(\u203b Yes, you\u2019ll have to kick out the drunks. Realistic, right?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking, crafting, managing, cleaning\u2014<br>it\u2019s all on me.<br>Pride? Nah. Just busy all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait\u2026 wasn\u2019t I forgetting something?<br>Oh, right. My uncle.<br>We\u2019ll find him eventually.<br>But first, let\u2019s get this tavern out of the red.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/daeb1e745de210583c88258a2715ed8b.avif?t=1768197201\" width=512 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/c453b126b0af5d93e0ed8f4b8438d9ca.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Explore Unknown Worlds Beyond the Rift!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From tranquil forests and mysterious mushroom colonies, to even modern convenience stores you could never have imagined! Explore dozens of randomly generated worlds every time you pass through a portal, and collect special ingredients for your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/992979a3a06cd0c09ebf395c6d43eca8.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-This Ain't No Simple Management: Defend Your Tavern!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serving food to guests and building your reputation is just the basics. Sometimes you'll have to crack the skulls of rowdy drunks, and other times you'll have to clean up vomit from the floor yourself. This is realistic tavern management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.webm?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/4ee95559c7eee647ffa7068624d3369c.mp4?t=1768197201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Create Fantastic Dishes with Otherworldly Ingredients!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new recipes by combining mysterious ingredients brought from the dimensional rifts. From ordinary stews to magical beverages, the dishes born from your hands will decide the fate of your tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.poster.avif?t=1768197201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902150/extras/cba27bdd61b96585c10664ade4bc910c.webm?t=1768197201